## Typography

### Type Scale

| Role | Typeface | Weight | Size | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| App Wordmark | Playfair Display | Italic 400 | — | Logo use only |
| Display / Avatar State | Fraunces | 600 | 28–36pt | Organic, a little imperfect |
| Section Headers | DM Serif Display | 400 | 20–24pt | Warm, editorial |
| Body / Primary UI | Instrument Serif | 400 | 15–17pt | Readable, characterful |
| Labels / Secondary | DM Sans | 400–500 | 12–14pt | Clean, unfussy |
| Numbers / Stats | Tabular variant of DM Sans | 500 | varies | Mono-numeral for alignment |
| Thought Bubbles / Ambient | Instrument Serif, italic | 400 | 14pt | The tamagotchi's voice |

**Key rule:** Serif for the companion's world (headers, avatar state, ambient observations). Sans-serif for the user's interface layer (labels, toggles, settings). The boundary is the character's vs. the app's voice.

