## Iconography

Icons use a **slightly rounded, 1.5pt stroke weight** style — not perfectly geometric, not too sketchy. Think a careful hand drawing with a fine-tip pen. Avoid filled/solid icons on primary surfaces; use outlines with selective accent fills.

Custom icon categories to commission:
- Food items (illustrated, not generic fork/knife)
- Exercise types (small gesture silhouettes)
- Hygiene items (toothbrush, shower head, etc. in the same hand-drawn style)
- Companion accessories (bottle types, hats, accessories for the avatar wardrobe)
- Period/cycle glyphs (moon phases, flower, wave — nothing clinical)

System SF Symbols are acceptable for purely functional UI elements (navigation, settings, toggles).

