## Motion Principles

Fernlet's motion language is **unhurried and gentle**. Nothing should feel urgent or demanding.

| Principle | Implementation |
|---|---|
| Ease curves | Always ease-out or custom spring curves. No linear motion. |
| Duration | UI transitions: 200–280ms. Avatar reactions: 300–500ms. Loading transitions: 600–800ms. |
| Entry | Elements float in softly (translateY 8–12pt + opacity). Never snap. |
| Exit | Elements dissolve (opacity only). Don't slide out aggressively. |
| Celebration | Gentle particle burst (goldenrod + fern). Small scale bounce (1.0 → 1.06 → 1.0). |
| No punishing motion | Nothing shakes, nothing flashes red, nothing demands attention. |

### Loading Screen Companions
The tamagotchi walks across the screen during AI inference. The walk cycle should be charming and slightly bouncy — this is a *feature moment*, not a spinner. A soft vignette fades in behind it. The text callout appears 300ms after the character enters frame.

