## Photowall

The Polaroid aesthetic is specific and intentional:

- Photos have a slightly off-white border (thicker at the bottom, like real Polaroids)
- Each card has a ~1–2 degree random rotation (seeded per photo, not truly random per render)
- A thin string or line element connects them across the background
- Soft drop shadow beneath each card
- On the gallery screen, photos un-rotate and grid up cleanly
- Full-screen view adds a subtle vignette

