## Accessibility Notes

- All avatar accessory items (glasses, mobility aids, etc.) are always available in the starter customization — never gated behind milestones.
- Color is never the *only* indicator of state (companion expression and text label always accompany color fills).
- Dynamic Type supported throughout. Layouts reflow at accessibility text sizes without breaking avatar placement.
- Reduce Motion mode: avatar reactions become instant opacity transitions; the loading screen walk becomes a fade-in-place.
- High Contrast mode: surface textures are reduced; color fills are replaced with higher-contrast alternatives from the palette.

