## What to Avoid

| Avoid | Use instead |
|---|---|
| Hard white backgrounds | Parchment (`#F5EFE0`) or Cream (`#FBF7EE`) |
| Purple/blue gradient hero sections | Warm moss and fern tones |
| Thin system fonts (SF Pro Regular) | Instrument Serif for body, DM Sans for labels |
| Red for low health/bad days | Terracotta, used sparingly and never punitively |
| Progress bars with a "fail" state | Fills that simply reflect where you are, not where you should be |
| Notification badges | Thought bubbles, dismissible ambient nudges |
| "You haven't logged in X days" copy | Silence, or a gentle companion animation |
| Streaks, flames, or calendar chains | Cumulative milestones only |
| Confetti for major milestones | Goldenrod particle burst, quiet animation |
| Clinical iconography | Illustrated, hand-drawn-adjacent icons |

